"Exact nonrelativistic motion in uniform fields (circle in pure B, cycloid or trochoid with E), so |v| in pure B stays fixed to rounding error. Speeds stop at {#}⁷ m/s (v/c = {#}). Field edges are sharp (no fringe fields), and the particle does not radiate.",
